  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Beginning at 3rd level, you gain proficiency in two of the following skills of your choice: Engineering, History, Investigation, Nature, or Religion. If you already have proficiency in one of the listed skills, you can instead gain expertise with the chosen skill. You gain proficiency in an additional skill from the list at 6th, 11th, and 17th level.</p>\n<p>Additionally, you may use your Intelligence score in place of your Wisdom score for all your Brawler abilities, including Unarmored Defense, Spirit Save DC, and more.</p>",
